  "bio": "Marie Lavraie is a masterful tattoo artist based in Bourges, France, known for her exquisite illustrative style that brings tattoos to life with vibrant colors and intricate details. She works at the esteemed Foxhole Tattoo Shop where her professionalism is matched only by the artistry she displays in every neotraditional, traditional, and neo-Japanese piece she creates. Patrons leave with stunning art on their skin and a deep appreciation for Marie's dedication to her craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Bourges, Centre-val De Loire, France",
